<h3>2000</h3>

<p>On February 1, Mandan adopted a city-manager form of administration with the appointment of {% person "james-neubauer" %}James Neubauer{% endperson %} as full-time city administrator. {% person "kevin-christ" %}Kevin Christ{% endperson %} had served as city auditor until June 1998. The auditor's duties had been divided among other city employees until the change.</p>

